@startuml
title State machine model of Staff Member Class

[*] --> Employed

state Employed
Employed : do / Assigned to client or campaign

state Unassigned
Unassigned : do / Returned to unassigned state

state Assigned
Assigned : do / Switch between assignments during work period

state Unemployed
Unemployed : do / Marked as unemployed when leaving job

state Archived
Archived : do / Archive record after some time has passed

Employed --> Assigned : Assignment event
Assigned --> Unassigned : Removal event or Switching event
Unassigned --> Employed : Assignment event
Employed --> Unemployed : Leaving Job event
Unemployed --> Archived : Archiving Time event
@enduml
